    "**BLEU** counts how many 1-,2-,3-,4-word sequences (n-grams) in our output also appear in the reference, with a *brevity penalty* so very short outputs aren't rewarded. Score range 0-100; higher is better. We use smoothing so a sentence with zero 4-gram matches doesn't zero out everything."
